Subject: R3, packed self attestation
Reason: Under attestation 'none' the L3 create() algorithm (5.1.3) forwards a zero-AAGUID, x5c-less packed statement unchanged and 7.1 step 24 lets the RP accept it, but the library rejected every fmt but none (audit 4.10); packed is now accepted only as self attestation: attStmt exactly {alg, sig}, alg equal to the credential key alg, zero AAGUID, sig verified over authData || SHA-256(clientDataJSON) with the credential key (SPEC 4.9, D-31).

